{"series":{"id":"strongest-upgrade","slug":"strongest-upgrade","title":"The Strongest Upgrade","image":"https://donghualife.com/images/webp/strongest-upgrade-1__coverImage.webp","synopsis":"Nuestro protagonista, Zhao Fang, es arrojado a un mundo de fantasía, pero hay una trampa. Está atrapado como un joven maestro impotente y caído en desgracia, con solo una sirvienta leal a su lado. Suena duro, ¿verdad? Pero Zhao Fang no está sudando. Gracias a su profunda experiencia en juegos, rápidamente descifra el sistema, explota los fallos que rompen el juego y comienza a subir de nivel como un profesional.Con cada reino secreto que conquista, Zhao Fang desbloquea nuevas habilidades, asume locas misiones asignadas por el sistema y demuestra que no es un jugador ordinario. Está aquí para dominar el mundo del juego, una mejora a la vez.","genres":["Acción","Cultivo","Venganza"],"sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/series/strongest-upgrade","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:34:48.399Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"strongest-upgrade-1","slug":"strongest-upgrade-1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/strongest-upgrade-1-1","image":null,"number":1,"seriesId":"strongest-upgrade","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/strongest-upgrade-1-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:35:13.705Z","episodeCount":40,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":40,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true}],"episodes":[{"id":"strongest-upgrade-1-1","slug":"strongest-upgrade-1-1","title":"The Strongest Upgrade — Cap. 1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/strongest-upgrade-1-1","servers":[],"previousUrl":null,"nextUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/strongest-upgrade-1-2","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:34:48.954Z","seriesId":"strongest-upgrade","seasonId":"strongest-upgrade-1","number":1,"releaseDate":null},{"id":"strongest-upgrade-1-2","slug":"strongest-upgrade-1-2","title":"The Strongest Upgrade — Cap. 2","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/strongest-upgrade-1-2","ser